        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fu Sha&quot; is a fast-paced and content-rich horror text adventure game. The entire game is based on realistic 3D scenes, combined with over fifty spine-chilling hand-drawn CGS and a concise horror script of more than 20,000 words. There is no lengthy or dragging build-up. It strives to create a situation where one is alone and trapped in a strange and terrifying predicament. The immersive and terrifying atmosphere when facing an escalating survival crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras/c275422dd729fd81b06c193d965ccd81.avif?t=1764031237\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of choices and endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arriving at this dilapidated inn by fate, every tiny choice you make will lead the story to a different development. You will encounter unpredictable and completely different terrifying events and lead to more than twenty different endings. Among them, there is only one way to ultimately escape. Lucky you, can you make the right choice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras/8feb8fd9d9e53c2e124d9703a0414901.avif?t=1764031237\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras_big/8feb8fd9d9e53c2e124d9703a0414901.avif?t=1764031237 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refuse to be startled by jumping faces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of sudden loud sound effects and sudden face scares? Don't worry. There won't be such heart-damaging elements here. &quot;Fu Sha&quot; is more like a traditional horror film. It neither overuses scares to create high energy nor loses the spine-chilling horror atmosphere. It might even extend beyond the game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras/18d90935ad47cbd39ba90e003be5b8b4.avif?t=1764031237\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras_big/18d90935ad47cbd39ba90e003be5b8b4.avif?t=1764031237 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow-up story plan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fu Sha&quot; itself is a complete story, and it is also the beginning of a hidden understory. In future sequels, we will continue to present more unique horror stories, and the understory will gradually emerge within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase suggestion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's suitable for cooling off in summer and giving as a gift to friends.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fu Sha&quot; is a fast-paced and content-rich horror text adventure game. The entire game is based on realistic 3D scenes, combined with over fifty spine-chilling hand-drawn CGS and a concise horror script of more than 20,000 words. There is no lengthy or dragging build-up. It strives to create a situation where one is alone and trapped in a strange and terrifying predicament. The immersive and terrifying atmosphere when facing an escalating survival crisis.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras/c275422dd729fd81b06c193d965ccd81.avif?t=1764031237\" width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A large number of choices and endings</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arriving at this dilapidated inn by fate, every tiny choice you make will lead the story to a different development. You will encounter unpredictable and completely different terrifying events and lead to more than twenty different endings. Among them, there is only one way to ultimately escape. Lucky you, can you make the right choice?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras/8feb8fd9d9e53c2e124d9703a0414901.avif?t=1764031237\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras_big/8feb8fd9d9e53c2e124d9703a0414901.avif?t=1764031237 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Refuse to be startled by jumping faces</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Tired of sudden loud sound effects and sudden face scares? Don't worry. There won't be such heart-damaging elements here. &quot;Fu Sha&quot; is more like a traditional horror film. It neither overuses scares to create high energy nor loses the spine-chilling horror atmosphere. It might even extend beyond the game...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras/18d90935ad47cbd39ba90e003be5b8b4.avif?t=1764031237\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3914000/extras_big/18d90935ad47cbd39ba90e003be5b8b4.avif?t=1764031237 width=1600 height=900 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Follow-up story plan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >&quot;Fu Sha&quot; itself is a complete story, and it is also the beginning of a hidden understory. In future sequels, we will continue to present more unique horror stories, and the understory will gradually emerge within them.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase suggestion</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's suitable for cooling off in summer and giving as a gift to friends.</p>",
        "short_description": "In the text adventure mode, spend a terrifying night of uncertain fate in a perilous hotel. &quot;Fu Sha&quot; has a large number of side options and endings. Any choice may trigger a terrifying situation that is hard to face. In the end, can you make the right choice and escape this curse of death?",
